# No trailing slash, deliberately: `node_modules/` matches **directories only**,
# and a `node_modules` **symlink** is not a directory. That is how two of them
# ended up committed — a `git add -A` in a worktree whose dependencies were
# symlinked to a sibling's, past an ignore rule that did not cover the case.
node_modules
dist/

# Embedded SQLite database (created/seeded on first launch — ADR-0003)
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal

# Session-local worktrees (git-flow: one worktree per story, never shared)
.claude/worktrees/

# Agentic HP suite scratch: scenario databases and the snapshots path 0 builds.
# Real imported Games, rebuilt from the network by re-running path 0 — never committed.
.agentic/
